          "domain_statement": "J ranges over the viscous-inertial transition; the paper reports St range 0.01-300, and J is related to St and I. The exact J range is not explicitly given, but the transition occurs at St=10.",
          "anchors": [
            {"line_start": 113, "line_end": 113, "support": "J = eta_f * dot_gamma / P"},
            {"line_start": 238, "line_end": 238, "support": "Range of St numbers in this study is 0.01-300"}
          ]
        },
